            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The GIL",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Default (GIL) build: ==one thread== runs bytecode at a time",
                "CPU-bound threads gain ==no speedup==",
                "Free-threaded build (`python3.14t`): no GIL, threads run in parallel",
                "GIL is released while waiting on I/O"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
